 "description": "Welcome to Lore Tales. I’m Daniel, and I make animated “What If” stories: one impossible question, followed all the way to its consequences.\n\nEvery video starts with an idea I choose and a story I shape myself: the characters, the twists, the ending and the real-world logic behind it. I direct the animation scene by scene and keep revising until the movement, timing and detail feel right. Each video takes a lot of time and work before it’s ready to publish.\n\nSubscribe so you don’t miss the next “What If”, and tell me in the comments which question I should answer next.\n",
